      "updated": 1792325013186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why split into stages?",
      "fontSize": 32,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why split into stages?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4a9eed",
      "backgroundColor": "#dbe4ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1211086910,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 879423138,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vo-TZHR3OFq-0hGICm2XD"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1792325013186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-TZHR3OFq-0hGICm2XD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56.35711669921875,
      "y": 626.25,
      "width": 377.2857666015625,
      "height": 157.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4a9eed",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aTV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1439386402,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 2089445462,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792325048647,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Overlap different resources\n\nDisk, CPU and network all work\nat the same time. Run it sequentially\nand two of the three sit idle.\nSame idea as CPU pipelining.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c1",
      "originalText": "1. Overlap different resources\n\nDisk, CPU and network all work\nat the same time. Run it sequentially\nand two of the three sit idle.\nSame idea as CPU pipelining.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 600,
      "width": 490,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#8b5cf6",
      "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1576366754,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1325024382,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "0Sg0VmFW5fC-LZpEPAzu9"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1792325013186,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "created": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0Sg0VmFW5fC-LZpEPAzu9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 575.9831237792969,
      "y": 626.25,
      "width": 398.03375244140625,
      "height": 157.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#8b5cf6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aUV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641308386,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 904884234,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792325048647,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Scale each stage independently\n\nSize each stage by its own bottleneck:\nscale workers for CPU, keep a few\nfixed writers for the DB connections\n(e.g. 16 workers, 4 writers).",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c2",
      "originalText": "2. Scale each stage independently\n\nSize each stage by its own bottleneck:\nscale workers for CPU, keep a few\nfixed writers for the DB connections\n(e.g. 16 workers, 4 writers).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
